Tracking memory utilized by insights cache.
The premise behind this document is to propose a solution for tracking the memory consumed by insights cache. For the first cut, we will primarily focus on entity and metric type cache objects. We won’t keep track of the memory consumed by other cache entries such as watches, entity trail objects, snapshot history etc.
To solve the problem, we will provide a base class for the cache objects: InsightsObjectBase, that provides a virtual function: Size() that returns the size of the object that it wraps.
