The IDF server periodically in the background will scan through all the entities of type “etype_needed_to_be_cleanedup”. For each entity in child table, IDF will extract the value of attribute name mentioned in field “parent_mapping_attribute_name” and use that as entity id to lookup entities in the entity type mentioned by field “parent_entity_type_name” and trigger cleanup of this entity if the parent entity is not found.

