## Configure on Replica
To support federation, enable gflag insights_experimental_enable_federation=true in insights_server.gflags.
Set insights_uploader_port=2029 in insights_server.gflags.
To expose receiver port, add 2028 (receiver port) under ports in IDF Service
- name: receiver
port: 2028
targetPort: 2028
protocol: TCP
and Statefulset
- containerPort: 2028
name: receiver
in idf_statefulset.yaml
Replica needs “__cloud_master_info__” entity to know about the Master and join the federation. Entity Details:
entity_guid {
entity_type_name: "_cloud_master_info_"
entity_id: "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}
attribute_data_arg_list {
attribute_data {
name: "server_handle"
value {
str_value: "<master-cluster-idf-server-ip>:2027"
}
}
}

